# Ruby sources are always text. Belt-and-braces against a stray control byte
# in a spec string making git call a whole file binary — which happened once
# with a raw NUL in recruit_source_spec.rb and hid an entire SSRF test change
# from code review ("Binary files differ"). The escapes in that spec are now
# written as \0 rather than embedded bytes; this keeps the diff readable even
# if one slips back in.
*.rb diff
